	(text "All the same diodes, as putting different ones doesn't make \nsense BOM wise. It should be fine for all signals as it\nprotects +-3.6V (so okay for the 3V3 signals) It's not the\n\"best\" (I.E. specific protection for each signal) but better\nthan nothing."
